{"metadata":{"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"title":[{"Plain":"Lambek 代数"},2],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"slug":[{"Plain":"Lambek代数"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>范畴 $\\mathcal C$ 的自函子 $F$ 的 <strong>Lambek 代数</strong>就是对象 $X\\in\\mathcal C$ 配备一个态射 $F(X)\\to X$. 记 $\\mathsf{alg}_F(\\mathcal C)$ 为 $F$-Lambek 代数的范畴.</p>\n<p>对偶地, $F$-<strong>Lambek 余代数</strong>是对象 $X\\in\\mathcal C$ 配备一个态射 $X\\to F(X)$. 记 $\\mathsf{coalg}_F(\\mathcal C)$ 为 $F$-Lambek 余代数的范畴.</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<h3>始对象</h3>\n<p>Lambek 代数范畴中的始对象是一种重要范畴论构造, 见"},{"Local":{"url":"始代数","text":"始代数"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h3>自由–遗忘伴随</h3>\n<p><strong>命题</strong> (参考 "},{"Local":{"url":"GHK-analytic-monads","text":"GHK"}},{"Plain":" 4.2 节). 设范畴 $\\mathcal C$ 具有"},{"Local":{"url":"滤余极限","text":"滤余极限"}},{"Plain":"和二元"},{"Local":{"url":"和(范畴论)","text":"和"}},{"Plain":", 自函子 $P\\colon \\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal C$ 保持"},{"Local":{"url":"滤余极限","text":"滤余极限"}},{"Plain":". 那么有"},{"Local":{"url":"单子性函子","text":"单子性"}},{"Plain":"的"},{"Local":{"url":"自由-遗忘伴随","text":"自由–遗忘伴随"}},{"Plain":"\n$$\r\nF\\colon \\mathcal C \\rightleftarrows \\mathsf{alg}_{P}(\\mathcal C)\\colon U,\r\n$$\n且这对伴随"},{"Local":{"url":"伴随给出单子","text":"给出的单子"}},{"Plain":" $\\overline{P}$ 正是自函子 $P$ 上的"},{"Local":{"url":"自由单子","text":"自由单子"}},{"Plain":". 进一步有\n$$\r\n\\mathsf{Alg}_{\\overline{P}}(\\mathcal C) \\simeq \\mathsf{alg}_P(\\mathcal C).\r\n$$</p>\n<h3>杠–余杠对偶</h3>\n<p>考虑"},{"Local":{"url":"扭箭头范畴","text":"扭箭头范畴"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathsf{Tw}(\\mathcal C) \\to\\mathcal C^{\\mathrm{op}}\\times\\mathcal C$ (即 $\\operatorname{Hom}\\colon \\mathcal C^{\\mathrm{op}}\\times\\mathcal C\\to\\mathsf{Ani}$ 的"},{"Local":{"url":"元素范畴","text":"元素范畴"}},{"Plain":"), 有函子\n$$\r\n\\mathsf{Tw}(P)\\colon \\mathsf{Tw}(\\mathcal C) \\to \\mathsf{Tw}(\\mathcal C),\r\n$$\n且其 Lambek 代数范畴有函子\n$$\r\n\\begin{aligned}\r\n\\mathsf{alg}_{\\mathsf{Tw}(P)}(\\mathsf{Tw}(\\mathcal C)) &amp;\\to \\mathsf{alg}_{P^{\\mathrm{op}}}(\\mathcal C^{\\mathrm{op}}) \\times \\mathsf{alg}_P(\\mathcal C) \\\\&amp;= \\mathsf{coalg}_P(\\mathcal C)\\times\\mathsf{alg}_P(\\mathcal C).\r\n\\end{aligned}\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}